### Register a customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}

### Register an organizer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "ORGANIZER"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}